+#: What K3 prefill's table publishes for its KDA configs (tt-metal ``kv_chunk_table.py``, tt-metal#63958): one
+#: Snapshot window, strides 96 / 64, and the state's segment sizes. The KV Manager refuses a copy unless decode's
